== Notes ==

* The aura protecting from evil ('''holy aura''') deals [[divine damage]], while the aura protecting from good ('''unholy aura''') deals [[negative energy damage]].
* Due to a game limitation, the alignment of an attacker does not affect whether or not the attacker is damaged by the aura. Nor does an enemy caster's alignment affect the spell resistance granted.
* Contrary to the description, opponent spell resistance is never checked by this spell.

